# Commands init runs after its own checks: one per line, words separated by blanks.
# The GPU's answer and nothing else (src/u2f_test.c, with gpu=1 adreno_keep=1): this runs
# before launchd, so no daemon of iOS can push the answer out of the loader's log -- which is
# what happened three runs in a row with the question asked from rc.jobs.
/redwood/bin/u2f_test
